id: pm-win-task-wait
title: Use elapsed-time task-state waits in the Windows MRTR regression
description: "Nightly40084795066 at93f71c0a3 passes13 of14 platform legs, including both Ubuntu22 shards. Windows24 shard2/4 fails mcp-server-branch-residual.spec.ts: the100-attempt five-ms tasks/get helper exhausts while waiting for input_required/failed. Preserve real request/response and durable task behavior while replacing iteration-count timing with a bounded elapsed-time wait. Related closed pm-tm6h9x fixed detached success cleanup, not this input/failure wait budget."
type: Issue
status: in_progress
priority: 1
