author: "harness:codex"
estimated_minutes: 60
acceptance_criteria: "A controlled task delay beyond the old nominal500ms wait fails before the fix and passes afterward; Retain MRTR input_required, resume, stable completion and protocol failure assertions; Pass the full affected Windows24 hosted shard without quarantining or skipping tests"
